# Per-network dev run directories (loom runDir is module-relative → under bettercosmic/): ignore all
# generated contents (saves, config, logs, companion-mod jars and their data) but keep the mods/
# folder's note so the companion-mod drop points are tracked.
bettercosmic/run-prisons/*
!bettercosmic/run-prisons/mods/
bettercosmic/run-prisons/mods/*
!bettercosmic/run-prisons/mods/README.md
bettercosmic/run-sky/*
!bettercosmic/run-sky/mods/
bettercosmic/run-sky/mods/*
!bettercosmic/run-sky/mods/README.md

